BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:🗓️ Your October at a glance
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261001
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261002
DTSTAMP:20261001T212435Z
UID:5a257e8ee58e689e014af68f@jentm1-arch.github.io/calendario-astral
DESCRIPTION:October asks you to slow down in the places that matter most: 
 love\, money\, identity and direction. Venus turns retrograde on October 3
  in your 8th house\, pulling you to revisit intimacy\, trust and shared re
 sources rather than start anything new there — this echoes a bigger patt
 ern\, since Jupiter is exactly opposing your natal Venus the same day (hou
 se 12 to house 6)\, stretching your sense of self-worth between private he
 aling and visible growth\; this repeats March and May 2027. Days later\, M
 ars squares Pluto\, intensifying power dynamics around shared resources (O
 ctober 1) — stay aware of control issues rather than forcing outcomes. M
 ercury begins its own shadow on October 4\, preparing you for a retrograde
  starting October 25 in your 9th house of beliefs and travel — tie loose
  ends in studies\, contracts or long-distance plans before then. Pluto tur
 ns direct on October 9\, easing pressure in your 12th house of rest. The N
 ew Moon on October 10 (8th house) invites quiet intentions around intimacy
 \; the Full Moon on October 26 in your 2nd house illuminates self-worth an
 d money. Jupiter also opposes your Ascendant exactly on October 24\, askin
 g you to balance self-expression with other people's needs.\n→ Where is 
 Venus retrograde asking you to review trust\, and where does Jupiter's pul
 l on your Ascendant push you to assert yourself instead?\n\nYou will find 
 more information and detail in the events of October in your calendar. Hap
 py October! ✨\n\nAlso today: Mercury (1°51' Scorpio\, house 8) conjunct
 ion your Pluto natal (1°51' Scorpio\, house 8) · exact 01/10 23:33\n\n
 —\n✨ Iris Calendar\n🥝 Updated on 01 Oct 2026\nhttps://mi-calendario
 -astral.netlify.app
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://mi-calendario-astral.netlify.app
